WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.935 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There's a pretty embarrassing
scene in the film

00:00:01.935 --> 00:00:03.503 align:start size:94% position:6%
where Charlize's character
is blackmailed

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:05.638 align:start size:94% position:6%
because of a video
that you are in.

00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:09.709 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes. In the film, they hack
into my little webcam.

00:00:09.709 --> 00:00:13.513
And, you know, I'm kind of
in a romantic relationship

00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:14.948 align:start size:94% position:6%
with a woman
running for president.

00:00:14.948 --> 00:00:17.217 align:start size:94% position:6%
So a big media conglomerate
hacks into my webcam

00:00:17.217 --> 00:00:21.855
and catches me doing what they
would actually catch me doing

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:22.956 line:92%
if they hacked into my webcam,

00:00:22.956 --> 00:00:26.659 align:start size:94% position:6%
which is disgusting things,
all the time.

00:00:26.659 --> 00:00:29.462 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.462 --> 00:00:31.164 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, so, yeah,
there's a scene where --

00:00:31.164 --> 00:00:33.033 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't know how to say it
elegantly.

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:36.102 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I'll just say it
and let you guys deal with it.

00:00:36.102 --> 00:00:37.837 line:92%
I [bleep] on my own face.

00:00:37.837 --> 00:00:40.240 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so I --
-That was elegant.

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:41.841 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're being hard on yourself.
That was elegant.

00:00:41.841 --> 00:00:44.944 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Not on purpose. It's not like
a thing my character does.

00:00:44.944 --> 00:00:47.514
It's not like the windbreakers.
It was not as strong.

00:00:47.514 --> 00:00:49.916 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's an accident
in the context of the film.

00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:51.618 align:start size:94% position:6%
But they capture it
on the webcam.

00:00:51.618 --> 00:00:54.821
And what's funny is, to film it,
I literally shot it

00:00:54.821 --> 00:00:58.091 align:start size:94% position:6%
on my own computer
alone in a hotel room

00:00:58.091 --> 00:00:59.325 size:81% position:41% line:92%
because it was like --

00:00:59.325 --> 00:01:03.363 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it wasn't real, but I did
have, like, an apparatus

00:01:03.363 --> 00:01:07.534 line:92%
to squirt myself in the face.

00:01:07.534 --> 00:01:11.071 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it is one of those moments
where I'm like,

00:01:11.071 --> 00:01:14.107 align:start size:94% position:6%
"What I'm pretending to do
and what I'm doing

00:01:14.107 --> 00:01:15.175 line:92%
are like a hair's breadth away

00:01:15.175 --> 00:01:17.610 align:start size:94% position:6%
from being as gross
as one another."

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:19.746 line:92%
Like, this is disgusting to do

00:01:19.746 --> 00:01:23.817
but works very well comedically
in the context of the film.

00:01:23.817 --> 00:01:26.786 size:84% position:42%
And I encourage you all
to go see "Long Shot."

00:01:26.786 --> 00:01:28.521 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.521 --> 00:01:32.325 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I am very excited.

00:01:32.325 --> 00:01:35.862
I was backstage. And we've
talked about your mom before.

00:01:35.862 --> 00:01:37.630 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Good segue.

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:40.433 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Speaking of [bleep]
on your own face,

00:01:40.433 --> 00:01:42.168 line:92%
your mother's backstage."

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:43.303 line:92%
-I mean, it's not any mother.

00:01:43.303 --> 00:01:45.872 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, it's Seth Rogen's
mother, so, yeah.

00:01:45.872 --> 00:01:47.140 line:92%
-She's fine with it, yeah.

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:48.842 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But we've talked about her
on social media.

00:01:48.842 --> 00:01:52.479
And I got to meet her backstage.
And it was lovely to meet her.

00:01:52.479 --> 00:01:53.379 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-She is a lovely woman.

00:01:53.379 --> 00:01:56.149
-And we also talked about
how you and Billy Eichner,

00:01:56.149 --> 00:01:58.685 align:start size:94% position:6%
