are going to be voices

00:01:58.685 --> 00:02:00.053 align:start size:94% position:6%
in "The Lion King."
-Yes. We are Timon and Pumbaa.

00:02:00.053 --> 00:02:03.490 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We didn't talk about that
you did "Billy on the Street."

00:02:03.490 --> 00:02:07.527 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you did a bit where
you basically went around --

00:02:07.527 --> 00:02:08.428 line:92%
What was the bit you were doing?

00:02:08.428 --> 00:02:11.431
-It was one of honestly the most
messed-up things I've ever done.

00:02:11.431 --> 00:02:14.033 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it actually
emotionally messed me up

00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:15.768 align:start size:94% position:6%
for around three weeks.
-Yeah.

00:02:15.768 --> 00:02:16.970 line:92%
-He went around New York,

00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:19.806 size:88% position:44%
and I was the cameraman
but kind of in disguise.

00:02:19.806 --> 00:02:23.543 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he was telling New Yorkers
that I was dead.

00:02:23.543 --> 00:02:25.145 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Audience ohhs ]

00:02:25.145 --> 00:02:26.513 size:78% position:39% line:92%
And I was filming it.

00:02:26.513 --> 00:02:29.549
And then they would react,
and at the end, he'd go,

00:02:29.549 --> 00:02:32.619 align:start size:94% position:6%
"He's not dead.
He's right here filming it."

00:02:32.619 --> 00:02:37.257 align:start size:94% position:6%
90% of people
did not give a [bleep].

00:02:37.257 --> 00:02:39.025 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.025 --> 00:02:43.463
And the other 10% were
kind of psyched about it.

00:02:43.463 --> 00:02:47.033
Genuinely, their first reaction
was like, "Fine."

00:02:47.033 --> 00:02:49.302 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, yeah, my mom
did not care for it.

00:02:49.302 --> 00:02:51.838 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Do you want to read --
Somebody tweeted --

00:02:51.838 --> 00:02:53.907
And then do you want to read
your mom's reaction to it?

00:02:53.907 --> 00:02:55.808 align:start size:94% position:6%
-My mom tweeted
to Billy Eichner.

00:02:55.808 --> 00:03:00.446 align:start size:94% position:6%
