00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:05.185 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
You are a bum."

00:03:05.185 --> 00:03:09.756 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
She's like Rocky's corner man.

00:03:09.756 --> 00:03:10.757 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"Ya bum!"

00:03:10.757 --> 00:03:12.759 size:78% position:39%
Even she had to admit
it was funny, though.

00:03:12.759 --> 00:03:14.260 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, she did admit
it was funny.

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:15.762 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thank you for
being here as always.

00:03:15.762 --> 00:03:17.597 align:start size:94% position:6%
It is just such a delight
to have you, Seth.

00:03:17.597 --> 00:03:20.600 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you for having me.
-That is Seth Rogen.

